title: International Relations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: international_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer += 12;
card-image: img/international.jpg
max-visits: 4
#subtitle: Building ties with our fraternal socialist parties.

At the Progressive Alliance, we can forge contacts with our fellow social democratic parties in Europe and across the world.

- @uk: Build relationships with the British Labour Party.
- @eu: Primarily build relations with members of the European S&D
- @scandi: Learn the path of economics and reform from the Scandinavian social democrats.
- @america: Contact the Democratic party in the US.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@uk
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; labor_strength += 5;

The social democrats of Britain...

@eu
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1 and european_unity >33
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?][? if european_unity < 34: Not enough European Unity ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 1; center_strength += 5; reformist_strength += 2; european_unity += 2

The social democrats of Europe...

@scandi
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: left_strength += 8; resources -= 1;

The programs of the Nordic social democrats...

@america
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; reformist_strength += 5;

The Democratic Party...

@reduce

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
